msgstr "未设置 PIN 码时留空。"

msgid "Lock modem to specific frequency bands. Select bands for each network type (UMTS/LTE/NR)."
msgstr "锁定模组频段。请为 UMTS、LTE 和 NR 分别选择频段。"

msgid "Once enabled, the PCIe ports will be scanned on every boot."
msgstr "启用后每次开机扫描 PCIe 端口。"

msgid "Once enabled, the USB ports will be scanned on every boot."
msgstr "启用后每次开机扫描 USB 端口。"

msgid "Path to SMS database file"
msgstr "短信数据库文件路径"

msgid "Power cycles the modem completely. Takes longer but ensures a full restart."
msgstr "为模组断电再上电，完成一次完整重启。"

msgid "Reboot the modem device. Soft reboot restarts the modem firmware, hard reboot power cycles the modem."
msgstr "重启模组。软重启重新启动模组固件，硬重启先断电再上电。"

msgid "Restarts the modem firmware without power cycling. Faster but may not resolve all issues."
msgstr "重新启动模组固件，保持供电。耗时较短，但可能无法解决部分故障。"

msgid "Scan neighboring cell towers and lock modem to specific cell. You can scan for nearby cells and then lock to a specific cell by copying its parameters."
msgstr "扫描邻区并将模组锁定到指定小区。可从扫描结果中复制小区参数。"

msgid "Select features to disable for this modem."
msgstr "选择要在此模组禁用的功能。"

msgid "Switch between SIM card slots. Note: Some modems may require a reboot after switching SIM slots."
msgstr "切换 SIM 卡槽。部分模组切换后需要重启。"

msgid "The metric value is used to determine the priority of the route. The smaller the value, the higher the priority. Cannot duplicate."
msgstr "路由跃点越小，优先级越高。各接口的值须不同。"

msgid "View and delete SMS messages stored on SIM card. These are raw messages before being processed into conversations."
msgstr "查看和删除 SIM 卡中的原始短信。"

msgid "View and manage SMS messages. Messages are grouped by sender/recipient."
msgstr "按发件人或收件人查看和管理短信。"

msgid "View and modify the modem IMEI number. IMEI must be 15 digits. Changes require modem reboot to take effect."
msgstr "查看和修改 15 位模组 IMEI。修改后需重启模组。"
